OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity data deleted
OL,4,A'methodically and selectively'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFiles relating to hundreds of maternity
OL,7,Fcases at a scandal-hit NHS trust were
OL,8,F"methodically and selectively deleted",
OL,9,Fan independent investigation found.
OL,11,FThe investigation followed a police
OL,12,Finquiry into the data breach at
OL,13,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)
OL,14,FNHS Trust - which was at the centre of
OL,15,Fthe biggest review of maternity
OL,16,Ffailings in NHS history - in July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
