OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1793991346
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity data deleted
OL,4,A'methodically and selectively'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJack Hawkins, whose daughter Harriet
OL,7,Fwas stillborn at Nottingham City
OL,8,FHospital - run by the trust - said it
OL,9,Fwas "terrifying" that the individual
OL,10,Fwho deleted the files could not be
OL,11,Fidentified by any investigation.
OL,13,FNUH has apologised for the distress
OL,14,Fcaused by the breach and a further data
OL,15,Fincident in August this year.
